review-rounds: 4 (of slices 02-06; this diff is unreviewed)
verdicts: FAIL, FAIL, FAIL, FAIL

All four batched reviewers returned FAIL. Slices 07 and 08 remediate what they found.

The claims reviewer independently reproduced every number across five commits -- test
counts, credo, dialyzer, deps.audit -- and recomputed all five signoff hashes
bit-for-bit. The quantitative process held. What failed was prose running ahead of the
diff: three "fixed" claims that were never applied, two completeness errors, one
paraphrased transcript, and citations pointing at a stale tree.

Asserts: gates passed -- test 7 held (171 tests), credo 77 held, dialyzer 43 held. The
draft_report masking hole and the uncaught throw were each verified by execution before
and after. False claims are retracted in place, not deleted.

Does NOT assert: that any reviewer examined THIS diff; that MCP egress is adequately
masked (the funnel is real now, PrivacyMask is still narrow, and summary/info/path
still carry unmasked values); or that the ingest path has test coverage.
